{"id":"u-8173c97c-9a64-4baa-aed3-5eb13d5d033f","src":"community","title":"Muscle Builder: Resensitization Plan","author":"JL","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/muscle-builder-resensitization-plan-3","desc":"This four-week mesocycle is structured to induce a phase of resensitization in the body. Through the deliberate reduction in training volumes, the implementation of heavier weights, and a decreased variety of movements, the aim is to attenuate the body's adaptational response. This process serves to restore sensitivity to subsequent high-volume training phases.\n\n- Select weights tailored to the prescribed Reps and RPE. Lower Reps and higher RPE values indicate the use of heavier weights.\n\n- Allow 2-3 minutes of rest between exercises, with shorter rest periods for isolation exercises and longer intervals for compound movements.\n\n- Implement active rest between training days, engaging in moderate activities such as walking.\n\n- Although this program spans only four weeks, it is recommended to incorporate a week of active rest following its completion. While gym activity is ok during this period, it should be of a light intensity.","level":["Intermediate","Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T02:51:10.335Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4","Day 5"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":7,"x":4}]},{"n":"Hack Squat","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":7,"x":4}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Calf Press (Leg Press Machine)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":7,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":7,"x":4}]},{"n":"Stiff Leg Deadlift","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":7,"x":4}]},{"n":"V-Handle Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Upright Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":7,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Barbell Row","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":7,"x":4}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","set